/-!
# The cubic Sylow construction for J.2.7

This boundary exports the constructed semidihedral local action, the literal
E₉ quotient and fixed subgroups, and the point-orbit contradiction excluding
E₂₇. The resulting ambient Sylow has order 27 and exponent three, with both
center and commutator mapped precisely onto the original B. All order-three
elements of G are conjugate, with actual ambient conjugators.

The earlier Aut(A₆) marking, its M₁₀ compatibility, B's Sylow placement in H,
and the transposition part of clause (7) remain explicit source inputs.
The parent J.2.7 assembly retains their discharge and the triple-cover
identification.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, J.2.7, printed p.437 (PDF p.448).
-/
